<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Muhammadu Attahiru I</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">killed 1903</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Muhammadu Attahiru I was the last independent sultan of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sokoto-caliphate">Sokoto</a>. When the British conquered the Sokoto <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">Caliphate</a> in 1903, he refused to submit and led his followers eastward in a hijra recalling <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/usman-dan-fodio">Usman dan Fodio</a>'s migration. He was killed in battle with British forces in 1903.</p></div>
